OL,3,ANvidia shares tumble over investigation
OL,4,Ainto Huang's affair with alleged
OL,5,AChinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of billions of dollars have
OL,8,Fbeen wiped off the value of Nvidia
OL,9,Fafter the US chipmaker announced an
OL,10,Findependent investigation would be
OL,11,Fcarried out into its chief executive's
OL,12,Faffair with an alleged Chinese spy.
OL,14,FThe tech firm saw its shares fall by
OL,15,Fabout 4% by close of trade on Monday
OL,16,Fafter Jensen Huang admitted having an
OL,17,Fextramarital affair.
OL,19,FNvidia's probe came after reports that
OL,20,Fthe US believed the Nvidia boss had
OL,21,Fbeen targeted in an espionage campaign
OL,22,Fby China.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
