OL,3,AGround Force and Homes Under the Hammer
OL,4,Astar Tommy Walsh dies aged 69
OL,5,
OL,6,FTommy Walsh, the building and DIY
OL,7,Fexpert known for starring on TV shows
OL,8,Fincluding Ground Force, Homes Under the
OL,9,FHammer and Challenge Tommy Walsh, has
OL,10,Fdied at the age of 69.
OL,12,FWalsh started his career as a
OL,13,Fprofessional builder before rising to
OL,14,Ffame alongside Alan Titchmarsh and
OL,15,FCharlie Dimmock on the BBC's Ground
OL,16,FForce from 1997 to 2005.
OL,18,FHe went on to also front popular
OL,19,Fprogrammes including Clean It, Fix It,
OL,20,Fand Cowboys and Angels, and joined
OL,21,Fdaytime TV favourite Homes Under the
OL,22,FHammer in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
