OL,3,AGround Force and Homes Under the Hammer
OL,4,Astar Tommy Walsh dies aged 69
OL,5,
OL,6,FWalsh's agent told BBC News he died
OL,7,F"peacefully after a long illness
OL,8,Fsurrounded by his family", and asked
OL,9,Ffor privacy for the family.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
